### Логин
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"client1","password":"client"}

### Ассистент (подставьте токен)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/assistant
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Купить печь для пекарни, 2,5 млн на 3 года"}

### Заявка
POST http://localhost:8000/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{"inn":"7700000001","legal_form":"OOO","sector":"retail","region_tier":"million","employees":10,"revenue":24000000,"profit_margin":0.16,"revenue_growth":0.08,"existing_debt":2400000,"active_loans":1,"collateral_value":0,"product":"working_capital","purpose":"working_capital","amount":2000000,"term":36}

### Ответ клиента: accept | sign | decline | provide_info
POST http://localhost:8000/api/applications/1/respond
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"accept"}

### Решение андеррайтера (токен operator)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/operator/applications/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"approve","comment":"Одобрено"}
